# v12-merlin: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: ignition-off holds at throttle 0 and 1.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 600 0 0.5
cut 600 0 5.3
sweep 600 1500 0 0.25
hold 1500 0 0.5
cut 1500 0 2.5
sweep 1500 2500 0 0.25
hold 2500 0 0.5
cut 2500 0 1.7
sweep 2500 3250 0 0.25
hold 3250 0 0.5
cut 3250 0 1.5
sweep 3250 600 1 0.25
hold 600 1 0.5
cut 600 1 5.3
sweep 600 1500 1 0.25
hold 1500 1 0.5
cut 1500 1 2.5
sweep 1500 2500 1 0.25
hold 2500 1 0.5
cut 2500 1 1.7
sweep 2500 3250 1 0.25
hold 3250 1 0.5
cut 3250 1 1.5
